    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικαταβάλλω</span></b> , only in 
			Ep.
		
		aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικάββᾰλον</span> (also -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμβ</span>-), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw down around</i> or <i>upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρη κόλποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.707
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὰ γαίῃ</span>
			<i>lay</i> him <i>prostrate</i> on . . , <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				37.582
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρας περικάμβαλε μήλου</span>
			<i>wrap</i> a sheepskin <i>round</i> it, Orac. in <i><span class="en">
				Damocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				1.15
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πένθος τινί, π. τινὰ
				ἄτῃ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.819
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.469
			</span></i>.</div>
